      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "In May 1998, respondent was convicted of a misdemeanor drug offense in a California court and was placed on 3 years' probation."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner (Malcom L. Stewart)",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1260",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d308d4d44a88da894367b357f5f3481ffc79da8b9be633d9c357a795835843bb",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d308d4d44a88-0000-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "I'm not aware of any cases in the California system in which the search condition has actually been invoked by a Federal officer, but I think it would apply by its terms to such searches."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice (unspecified)",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1260",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d308d4d44a88da894367b357f5f3481ffc79da8b9be633d9c357a795835843bb",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d308d4d44a88-0000-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: The actual search was conducted by State officers, as I understand it."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner (Malcom L. Stewart)",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1260",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d308d4d44a88da894367b357f5f3481ffc79da8b9be633d9c357a795835843bb",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d308d4d44a88-0000-0004",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "the State could -- could commit him, could put him -- put him in the house of correction."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice (unspecified)",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1260",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d308d4d44a88da894367b357f5f3481ffc79da8b9be633d9c357a795835843bb",
